            {
                "entry_id": "0f5d8340-17a0-3591-aef0-55b317841e9f",
                "word": "scierie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2ab51064-314d-44a5-afa8-38b3ba6514bd",
                        "entry_id": "0f5d8340-17a0-3591-aef0-55b317841e9f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "scieries"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "772497b7-1c67-3cb7-b632-b00f98b2d715",
                        "entry_id": "0f5d8340-17a0-3591-aef0-55b317841e9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Usine où des scies, mises en mouvement par quelque agent naturel ou mécanique, scient en long la pierre, le bois, le marbre, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Industrie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c26576be-3f3c-4e34-ac72-fa5646f31ecf",
                                "sense_id": "772497b7-1c67-3cb7-b632-b00f98b2d715",
                                "text": "Depuis plusieurs années, on met en usage des scieries qui reçoivent leur mouvement de machines à vapeur et qui sont établies tantôt dans les coupes mêmes, tantôt sur des points rapprochés des forêts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f936c4e2-51c9-4402-b760-02fd28ce993f",
                                "sense_id": "772497b7-1c67-3cb7-b632-b00f98b2d715",
                                "text": "Cette scierie est toute primitive : la pièce de bois est posée sur deux tréteaux élevés, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5bd011cf-4fa2-4892-921c-a96a69ebc171",
                        "source_entry_id": "0f5d8340-17a0-3591-aef0-55b317841e9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "772497b7-1c67-3cb7-b632-b00f98b2d715",
                        "source_sense_description": "Usine",
                        "target_lang_word": "Sägewerk",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sägewerk",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "608f13f3-5c83-3b50-afed-d9ec59013764",
                                        "entry_id": "e686aba2-29e1-3e58-8f17-7a5833f4e446",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Betrieb, der Schnittholz wie Balken, Bretter oder Latten mittels Gattersägen aus Baumstämmen herstellt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e63ffce0-2de3-4270-a1bd-dc17fda64a50",
                                                "sense_id": "608f13f3-5c83-3b50-afed-d9ec59013764",
                                                "text": "„Ein Großfeuer hat in einem Sägewerk bei Braunschweig einen Schaden in Millionenhöhe angerichtet. Rund 250 Feuerwehrleute waren 14 Stunden lang mit den Löscharbeiten in Broistedt beschäftigt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58061721-0bc3-4568-8167-eb1c254e5249",
                                                "sense_id": "608f13f3-5c83-3b50-afed-d9ec59013764",
                                                "text": "„Wir kommen an ein Sägewerk.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5dca1cc-f7af-4b7c-9b1c-b32a2169a1f9",
                                                "sense_id": "608f13f3-5c83-3b50-afed-d9ec59013764",
                                                "text": "„Im Sägewerk war er angestellt gewesen, und sie hatte mit dem Stück Land hinterm Haus etwas dazuverdient.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a8d92fe-eb8a-4be4-a94b-e9e5adce0518",
                                                "sense_id": "608f13f3-5c83-3b50-afed-d9ec59013764",
                                                "text": "„Als wir in der rue Notre-Dame-des-Champs in der obersten Etage eines Nebengebäudes auf dem Hof des Sägewerks wohnten, war die Closerie des Lilas das nächstgelegene gute Café, eines der nettesten Cafés in Paris.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50aca9d5-358f-32ef-b3d6-9c5be0a419ec",
                                        "entry_id": "e686aba2-29e1-3e58-8f17-7a5833f4e446",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die zentrale, technische Sägevorrichtung von [1]"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "66063215-9aba-4ef3-90b4-e5392c962691",
                        "source_entry_id": "0f5d8340-17a0-3591-aef0-55b317841e9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "772497b7-1c67-3cb7-b632-b00f98b2d715",
                        "source_sense_description": "Usine",
                        "target_lang_word": "sawmill",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sawmill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                        "entry_id": "5e04e34a-ee8b-3664-a635-163b1f1c4e9b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A machine, building or company used for cutting (milling) lumber, or (rarely) other hard materials such as stone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "754208e8-0878-4528-8c63-c50837ffbee6",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "He brought his portable sawmill and turned the old beams into interesting flooring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "079b845b-688a-4637-bc6d-7992d75a060c",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "The old sawmill still has its waterwheel but they took the saw away years ago."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdf88a4f-46b0-4019-b33f-4f6fe4ae5036",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "The sawmill sells lumber to carpenters and sawdust to gardeners."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd4fdc52-0fda-4da3-8ee6-b560a43660f2",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "When I came to the saw-mill at Brække, the sky was overcast, it was already growing dark, only above the level of the north-western horizon there appeared a streak of light, which threw a subdued glimmer on the tranquil surface of the mill-pond."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c26a931a-3492-4a6c-8f2d-c8cb926a0b58",
                                                "sense_id": "44f5ac1f-4a01-30eb-bd50-b7ef1538cad3",
                                                "text": "My client welcomed the judge […] and they disappeared together into the Ethiopian card-room, which was filled with the assegais and exclamation point shields Mr. Cooke had had made at the sawmill at Beaverton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sawmill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
